# Native automorphism realization of the original unitary middle action

The faithful full-common-normalizer action extends to native projective
unitary automorphisms, preserving both endpoint maps and the entire middle.
Both original unitary rows and both orientations are included. Source:
Aschbacher–Smith 5.3.2, printed p.659.
